{"timestamp": 1779350415.067725, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Alice\u2019s body in Electrical, right by the task area. My route was Storage -> Medbay -> Electrical. I saw Frank in Medbay around ticks 6-7, and I specifically saw him enter Medbay from the Electrical side at tick 6. Then when I went into Electrical, Alice was dead there. I didn\u2019t see anyone else nearby. Frank coming from Electrical right before I found the body is the main thing I have."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350423.981057, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I don\u2019t have much direct info. I started Upper Engine, went to Oxygen, then came back to Upper Engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone at all, and I never went near Electrical/Medbay/Storage this round. So I can\u2019t confirm or deny Eve\u2019s report, but if she saw Frank coming from Electrical into Medbay right before finding Alice dead in Electrical, that\u2019s definitely important."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350437.09114, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was Navigation -> Security -> Weapons. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all.\n\nImportant thing: I saw Charlie enter Security from the Electrical side around tick 6. Later, around tick 10, I saw Charlie leaving Weapons toward Cafeteria. So Charlie was also coming from the Electrical area at basically the same time Eve says Frank came from Electrical into Medbay.\n\nI can\u2019t clear or accuse Frank because I didn\u2019t see him, but I think we need to hear from Charlie too. Right now both Frank and Charlie had proximity to Electrical near when Alice died."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350463.522034, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can explain the Medbay thing. My route was Medbay -> Electrical -> back through Medbay -> Storage. I was in Electrical early and I saw Charlie there, then Alice came in from Cafeteria. Charlie left toward Security, and I left after doing the panel stuff \u2014 I did not see a body when I left.\n\nEve seeing me in Medbay is accurate, but I was already out of Electrical at that point and heading away. The part that lines up weird to me is Diana also seeing Charlie coming from the Electrical side into Security around that same window. I definitely saw Charlie in Electrical with Alice before that, so Charlie needs to explain his timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350485.080224, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I was Electrical -> Security -> Weapons. In Electrical I saw Frank there first, then Alice came in from Cafeteria around tick 3. At tick 4 I still saw both Frank and Alice in Electrical. I left through the Security side and saw Diana in Security around tick 6, then later Diana saw me in Weapons around tick 10.\n\nSo yes, Diana is right that I came from the Electrical side, but that\u2019s because I left Electrical toward Security and never went back. The key point is Frank was in Electrical with Alice when I left, and Eve says she saw Frank coming from Electrical into Medbay right before finding Alice dead in Electrical. Frank even says I left before him, which means he was the one still there with Alice after me.\n\nI think the strongest vote is Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350503.745026, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Just to restate my info clearly: I reported Alice\u2019s body in Electrical, right by the task area. My route was Storage -> Medbay -> Electrical. I saw Frank enter Medbay from the Electrical side at tick 6, then still in Medbay at tick 7. When I went into Electrical right after that, Alice was already dead.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Charlie myself, but Diana confirms Charlie went Electrical -> Security -> Weapons, and Charlie\u2019s story lines up with that. Frank also admits Charlie left Electrical before him, meaning Frank was the last one confirmed there with Alice before I found the body.\n\nSo from my perspective, Frank has the strongest opportunity and the timing fits him best."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350513.3808582, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I still don\u2019t have any direct sightings from my side \u2014 I was Upper Engine -> Oxygen -> Upper Engine and saw nobody, so I\u2019m not clearing anyone.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, Frank looks the worst to me. Charlie\u2019s path is backed up by Diana seeing him go Electrical side into Security and later Weapons. Eve\u2019s report also puts Frank coming from Electrical into Medbay right before the body was found. And Frank himself says Charlie left before him, meaning Frank was still in Electrical with Alice after Charlie left.\n\nSo unless there\u2019s some missing timing detail, I think Frank is the strongest suspect here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350529.962555, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was Navigation -> Security -> Weapons. I never went into Electrical or Medbay, and I did not see Alice at all.\n\nWhat I can confirm is Charlie\u2019s movement: at tick 6, I saw Charlie enter Security from the Electrical side, and later around tick 10 I saw him leave Weapons toward Cafeteria. So Charlie\u2019s story of Electrical -> Security -> Weapons matches what I saw.\n\nI did not see Frank, so I can\u2019t directly confirm Eve\u2019s sighting, but the timing makes Frank look worse: Eve saw Frank coming from Electrical into Medbay right before finding Alice dead in Electrical, and Frank says Charlie left Electrical before him. That would leave Frank as the last confirmed person with Alice. Right now I think Frank is the strongest suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350560.6584141, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I get why it looks bad from the surface, but people are treating \u201cI came from Electrical\u201d as equal to \u201cI killed,\u201d and that\u2019s not what happened.\n\nMy exact route was Medbay -> Electrical -> Medbay -> Storage. I saw Charlie in Electrical first, then Alice came in from Cafeteria. Charlie left toward Security, yes. I left through Medbay after that, and I did not see Alice dead when I left. Eve then comes through Medbay into Electrical right after me and reports.\n\nSo from my POV, the only people with actual access in that window are me and Eve, and Eve is the one who \u201cfinds\u201d it immediately after following my path. If Alice was dead when I left, I would have had to walk past the body and somehow not report it with Eve right behind me \u2014 that makes no sense as goose play OR duck play.\n\nAlso, Eve\u2019s route starts Storage -> Medbay -> Electrical, which means she had no one vouching for her before the report. I\u2019m not saying Charlie is fully clear, but Diana at least backs his route. Nobody backs Eve\u2019s timing except Eve.\n\nI think this is either a self-report from Eve or she\u2019s forcing the timing onto me because she saw me nearby. I\u2019m voting Eve here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779350585.2294478, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route and sightings are exactly: Electrical -> Security -> Weapons.\n\nIn Electrical, I saw Frank there first, then Alice came in from Cafeteria at tick 3. At tick 4, both Frank and Alice were still alive and in Electrical with me. I left through the Security side and did not go back. Diana saw me come into Security from Electrical side around tick 6, then saw me again in Weapons later, so my route is backed up.\n\nFrank is saying Eve could be self-reporting, but from the confirmed info, Frank was the last person I know was still in Electrical with Alice after I left. Eve says she saw Frank come from Electrical into Medbay right before finding the body, and that lines up with him leaving the scene.\n\nI don\u2019t think \u201cI didn\u2019t see the body\u201d clears him \u2014 a duck would leave the body and keep moving. The cleanest timeline is Frank stayed behind with Alice after I left, killed, then went Medbay. I\u2019m voting Frank."}}
